h\":\"/sQaesFBOHjDgL1ah43xRZpLsW2W.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":406122,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Toy Story at 20: To Infinity and Beyond\",\"overview\":\"Retrospective looking at the revolutionary computer-animated feature film Toy Story.\",\"popularity\":2.529,\"poster_path\":\"/e1A7HontTztPtBCGwAHqIF0CIj4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2015-12-10\",\"title\":\"Toy Story at 20: To Infinity and Beyond\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.9,\"vote_count\":12,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"57ab202fc3a36827b4001039\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/n77OxYu5POTaHiCKxkdAX9ko5zZ.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":252451,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Defying the Nazis: The Sharps' War\",\"overview\":\"Join an American couple’s courageous mission in 1939 to help refugees escape Nazi-occupied Europe. Over the course of two years, the pair will risk their lives so that hundreds can live in freedom.\",\"popularity\":2.124,\"poster_path\":\"/j04DNPW8qTh3Y9CH73olyTEiAuk.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2016-09-20\",\"title\":\"Defying the Nazis: The Sharps' War\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.9,\"vote_count\":15,\"character\":\"Waitstill Sharp (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"57bbc639c3a368301300088e\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/h5jqLrIv1tlszezv2UEWq9KBuoj.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,36],\"id\":446354,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Post\",\"overview\":\"A cover-up that spanned four U.S. Presidents pushed the country's first female newspaper publisher and a hard-driving editor to join an unprecedented battle between journalist and government. Inspired by true events.\",\"popularity\":12.655,\"poster_path\":\"/h4XG3g6uMMPIBPjAoQhC2QIMdkl.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2017-12-22\",\"title\":\"The Post\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.996,\"vote_count\":4168,\"character\":\"Ben Bradlee\",\"credit_id\":\"58c43116c3a368536200010d\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8jELoQY7JosQaGOtLmlVHJzUzeq.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":464729,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Story Behind 'Toy Story'\",\"overview\":\"The documentary short of Toy Story of why and how the feature length blockbuster sleeper movie became a success and helps to boost Pixar's popularity of making one of the few animation movie production companies in the world today, especially in North America.\",\"popularity\":1.735,\"poster_path\":\"/rOaeh83eylKNBkPxUMAUAogb7rS.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1996-12-18\",\"title\":\"The Story Behind 'Toy Story'\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.3,\"vote_count\":12,\"character\":\"Himself\",\"credit_id\":\"595d127a9251415a400439f8\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/cSJMk9Jar8SibFXL8JAF9p2fhKu.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,36],\"id\":501907,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"A Beautiful Day in the Neighborhood\",\"overview\":\"An award-winning cynical journalist, Lloyd Vogel, begrudgingly accepts an assignment to write an Esquire profile piece on the beloved television icon Fred Rogers. After his encounter with Rogers, Vogel's perspective on life is transformed.\",\"popularity\":12.688,\"poster_path\":\"/p9vCAVhDK375XyobVcKqzqzsUHE.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2019-09-07\",\"title\":\"A Beautiful Day in the Neighborhood\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.008,\"vote_count\":1376,\"character\":\"Fred Rogers\",\"credit_id\":\"5a709346c3a36847e4012aaa\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/xUgWf8zeBbirS9YVIFDY3Dp6VEk.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10402,99],\"id\":325450,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Dave Clark Five and Beyond: Glad All Over\",\"overview\":\"The Dave Clark Five started the rock n roll British invasion that changed the world, having already knocked The Beatles out of the #1 position in the UK. Watch newly-filmed interviews with Tom Hanks, Paul McCartney, Elton John, Bruce Springsteen, Stevie Wonder, Dionne Warwick and many more, as they share their memories of how the music of the 60s and the cultural revolution of 1964 changed their lives forever. Bonus disc includes 2 hours of extra interview scenes and rare archival footage, including never-before-seen star performances and alternate performances from The DC5 ! Featuring 4 hours of star-studded performances in total!\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":\"/jNTueLKnIavVd1hUNO2c55wnWfF.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2014-05-13\",\"title\":\"The Dave Clark Five and Beyond: Glad All Over\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"5c732730c3a3685a44177f59\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/kaoTwHrJDmCPDLriN68pjlgx4R.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,10402,36],\"id\":614934,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Elvis\",\"overview\":\"The life story of Elvis Presley as seen through the complicated relationship with his enigmatic manager, Colonel Tom Parker.\",\"popularity\":60.287,\"poster_path\":\"/qBOKWqAFbveZ4ryjJJwbie6tXkQ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2022-06-22\",\"title\":\"Elvis\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.636,\"vote_count\":2541,\"character\":\"Colonel Tom Parker\",\"credit_id\":\"5d2897a8a294f0000f2913d3\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":729031,\"original_language\":\"de\",\"original_title\":\"Die Clint Eastwood Story\",\"overview\":\"German Documentary on Clint Eastwood\",\"popularity\":1.531,\"poster_path\":\"/duInEKeZfJl0rhj24RXjGz3SUB4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2018-02-07\",\"title\":\"Die Clint Eastwood Story\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"5f28ee8eb1f68d00376d1e11\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/nnUQqlVZeEGuCRx8SaoCU4XVHJN.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[14,12,10751],\"id\":532639,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Pinocchio\",\"overview\":\"A wooden puppet embarks on a thrilling adventure to become a real boy.\",\"popularity\":93.384,\"poster_path\":\"/g8sclIV4gj1TZqUpnL82hKOTK3B.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2022-09-07\",\"title\":\"Pinocchio\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.486,\"vote_count\":1348,\"character\":\"Geppetto\",\"credit_id\":\"5fd2b7cd3f7e1d0040b8ffc9\",\"order\":1,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":127850,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Inventing David Geffen\",\"overview\":\"Notoriously press and camera-shy, David Geffen reveals himself for the first time in this unflinching portrait of a complex and compelling man. His far-reaching influence - as an agent and manager, record industry mogul, Hollywood and Broadway producer, and billionaire philanthropist - has helped shape American popular culture for the past four decades. This documentary offers a rare insight into the world of the man responsible for launching the early successes of Joni Mitchell, Tom Cruise, and Guns N’ Roses; co-founded DreamWorks; produced Cats and Dreamgirls;  and is one of the largest contributors to the fight against AIDS. (SBS AU)  Geffen narrates his unorthodox rise from working class Brooklyn boy to billionaire entertainment power broker in extensive interviews.  American Masters explores the highs and the lows in Geffen’s professional and personal life through more than 50 new interviews with his friends, colleagues and clients, as well as other media luminaries. (PBS)\",\"popularity\":1.507,\"poster_path\":\"/eNJFdM0trGlwThfH6iLrg8QDLan.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2012-11-19\",\"title\":\"Inventing David Geffen\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.8,\"vote_count\":4,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4b0ac3a368484e17484d\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/9S2Id7rzj5B9MEI1CnpUHnf24cS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[12,16,35,10751],\"id\":213121,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Toy Story of Terror!\",\"overview\":\"What starts out as a fun road trip for the Toy Story gang takes an unexpected turn for the worse when the trip detours to a roadside motel. After one of the toys goes missing, the others find themselves caught up in a mysterious sequence of events that must be solved before they all suffer the same fate in this Toy Story of Terror.\",\"popularity\":1.008,\"poster_path\":\"/oPBEnNP4Fg4gv9c0KBhchmtoG4H.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2013-10-16\",\"title\":\"Toy Story of Terror!\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.193,\"vote_count\":809,\"character\":\"Woody (Voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4dbec3a368484e1fac11\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":237353,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Through the Eyes of Forrest Gump\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the scenes of Robert Zemeckis' 1994 Oscar-winning film, 'Forrest Gump'.\",\"popularity\":3.909,\"poster_path\":\"/dfjLE1HjdR9XhEpN04elCGUOJfA.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1994-10-01\",\"title\":\"Through the Eyes of Forrest Gump\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.8,\"vote_count\":17,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4e69c3a36847f828ea91\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/wSYtLAK3gQ4VSJGmREevFQhwxB8.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10751,12,35],\"id\":256835,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Toy Story That Time Forgot\",\"overview\":\"During a post-Christmas play date, the gang find themselves in uncharted territory when the coolest set of action figures ever turn out to be dangerously delusional. It's all up to Trixie, the triceratops, if the gang hopes to return to Bonnie's room in this Toy Story That Time Forgot.\",\"popularity\":20.906,\"poster_path\":\"/pw1YgzcBw4GmwylrFlXMzLdELRo.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2014-12-02\",\"title\":\"Toy Story That Time Forgot\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.0,\"vote_count\":877,\"character\":\"Woody (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"543d70930e0a266f8400032c\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":43714,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Harryhausen Chronicles\",\"overview\":\"As an actor, director and producer, Ray Harryhausen has been a vibrant figure in Hollywood, working on everything from family films to mind-bending sci-fi. But his true genius lay in the creation of special effects for movies such as Mighty Joe Young and It Came from Outer Space. Narrated by Leonard Nimoy and featuring appearances by George Lucas and Ray Bradbury, this film documents Harryhausen's remarkable life's work.\",\"popularity\":0.688,\"poster_path\":\"/xP4CR20quD3iNi0qKxyhpjs0YNr.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1997-01-01\",\"title\":\"The Harryhausen Chronicles\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.2,\"vote_count\":5,\"character\":\"Himself (archive footage)\",\"credit_id\":\"58569e5092514146c903cdbc\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/zOpB3aAL935XXxvdA1wjUuHFn5C.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":550600,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Mayo Clinic\",\"overview\":\"The Mayo Clinic tells the story of a unique medical institution that has been called a \\\"Medical Mecca,\\\" the \\\"Supreme Court of Medicine,\\\" and the \\\"place for hope where there is no hope.\\\" The Mayo Clinic began in 1883 as an unlikely partnership between the Sisters of Saint Francis and a country doctor named William Worrall Mayo after a devastating tornado in rural Minnesota. Since then, it has grown into an organization that treats more than a million patients a year from all 50 states and 150 countries. Dr. Mayo had a simple philosophy he imparted to his sons Will and Charlie: \\\"the needs of the patient come first.\\\" They wouldn't treat diseases...they would treat people. In a world where healthcare delivery is typically fragmented among individual specialties, the Mayo Clinic practices a multi-specialty, team-based approach that has, from its beginnings, created a culture that thrives on collaboration.\",\"popularity\":1.872,\"poster_path\":\"/zojyFTrXTdULii1Jh5yHmG0ZTHq.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2018-09-25\",\"title\":\"The Mayo Clinic\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.0,\"vote_count\":5,\"character\":\"Will Mayo\",\"credit_id\":\"5bab96dbc3a3683ac902692b\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8McBKWoQOQZfeIGQl23g0TJ6jto.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99,10402],\"id\":504561,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Quincy\",\"overview\":\"An intimate look into the life of icon Quincy Jones. A unique force in music and popular culture for 70 years, Jones has transcended racial and cultural boundaries; his story is inextricably woven into the fabric of America.\",\"popularity\":7.783,\"poster_path\":\"/yYtY9CRLyz4dXqTOiimdMF7Nt4e.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2018-09-21\",\"title\":\"Quincy\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.4,\"vote_count\":89,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"5bac137f92514150ee029a76\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":606078,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"People Like Us: Making 'Philadelphia'\",\"overview\":\"10 years after the release of \\\"Philadelphia,\\\" director Jonathan Demme, Tom Hanks, Denzel Washington and others discuss about the making of that film and it's important legacy through the years of being the first mainstream Hollywood film about dealing with the topic of Aids, revealing its impact on culture and society. Cast and crew talk about the inception of the project, the making of it and curious stories about one of the greatest hits of 1993.\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":\"/f729hoffrFAOuTkhymgi0b4hszW.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2004-07-19\",\"title\":\"People Like Us: Making 'Philadelphia'\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.0,\"vote_count\":1,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"5cf19b4d92514138ccb9316b\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hbrXbVoE0NuA1ORoSGGYNASagrl.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"id\":740985,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Borat Subsequent Moviefilm\",\"overview\":\"14 years after making a film about his journey across the USA, Borat risks life and limb when he returns to the United States with his young daughter, and reveals more about the culture, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the political elections.\",\"popularity\":16.076,\"poster_path\":\"/3L1Ml5RWjFVfVq3rQENvgFymT0U.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2020-10-23\",\"title\":\"Borat Subsequent Moviefilm\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.476,\"vote_count\":2157,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"5f9234ea278d8a00373b5012\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/dExUxMWt0UjS93waeCGYeDr1D7m.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,10749,878],\"id\":747188,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Asteroid City\",\"overview\":\"Set in a fictional American desert town circa 1955, the itinerary of a Junior Stargazer/Space Cadet convention (organized to bring together students and parents from across the country for fellowship and scholarly competition) is spectacularly disrupted by world-changing events.\",\"popularity\":21.933,\"poster_path\":\"/qdq40gRS8xKnpFt5V75t6lUHgpx.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2023-06-09\",\"title\":\"Asteroid City\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"\",\"credit_id\":\"61045303ad87f7002ff752d2\",\"order\":2,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bzjGojNGoLuGvbaeEbjI8BFhJ1f.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"id\":16279,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Great Buck Howard\",\"overview\":\"When a law school dropout answers an advertisement to be a personal assistant he unknowingly signs on to work for a belligerent has-been magician struggling to resurrect his career. This leads to a journey across the country staging the comeback of a lifetime.\",\"popularity\":11.514,\"poster_path\":\"/9x5EajLkxeS3vqWaQTVO0gQ2lMP.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2008-01-18\",\"title\":\"The Great Buck Howard\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.971,\"vote_count\":209,\"character\":\"Mr. Gable\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe46bf9251416c75082477\",\"order\":3,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":56235,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Return with Honor\",\"overview\":\"The story of U.S. fighter pilots shot down over North Vietnam who became POWs for up to 8 and a half years.\",\"popularity\":1.125,\"poster_path\":null,\"release_date\":\"1999-06-11\",\"title\":\"Return with Honor\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.9,\"vote_count\":9,\"character\":\"Narrator\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe48f5c3a36847f81822a1\",\"order\":3,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":380994,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Mike Nichols: An American Master\",\"overview\":\"With charm and wit, Nichols discusses his life and 50-year career as a performer and director.\",\"popularity\":1.185,\"poster_path\":\"/wOMSIJeIt3LunhwSeSF7LO2JuPe.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2016-01-29\",\"title\":\"Mike Nichols: An American Master\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.2,\"vote_count\":8,\"character\":\"\",\"credit_id\":\"56b2431392514103380004b3\",\"order\":3,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":471198,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Universal Story\",\"overview\":\"Richard Dreyfuss hosts a celebration of the 80 year history of Universal Studios. Founded as IMP by Carl Leammle to oppose Edison's Motion Picture Tust, it soon grew under the leadership of 21 year old production head Irving Thalberg with classic silents from artists like John Ford, Erich Von Stroheim, and Lon Chaney and prospered further in the Sound Era under the leadership of Carl Leammle Jr. with such classics as \\\"All Quiet on The Western Front,\\\" \\\"Showboat,\\\" and the studio's signature monster franchises, \\\"Frankenstein\\\" and \\\"Dracula.\\\"\",\"popularity\":1.233,\"poster_path\":\"/QmEOPgTZ9hELnWSmfzelaqAriU.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1996-04-21\",\"title\":\"The Universal Story\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.7,\"vote_count\":3,\"character\":\"Himself (archive footage)\",\"credit_id\":\"5b6be82092514140641214e4\",\"order\":3,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/6rmc43jaxcztIGEeAq2zBIQGQ8L.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"id\":712062,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Pennis from Heaven\",\"overview\":\"Wherever he goes, Dennis Pennis (Paul Kaye) leaves a trail of embarrassment in his wake. From London to the Venice Film Festival and on to Hollywood, no-one is spared, no star is too big to escape verbal abuse. Victims include Steve Martin, Pierce Brosnan, Don Johnson, Jim Carrey, Richard Gere, Sharon Stone, Sandra Bullock, Charlie Sheen, Cindy Crawford, Demi Moore and Arnold Schwarzennegger. If you're a star, beware! Pennis is out to get you. This release includes previously released Very Important Pennis, Anyone For Pennis? and RIP - Too Rude to Live.\",\"popularity\":0.953,\"poster_path\":\"/c1HiJwCJy8OMdrJCmzSD8Wiz89c.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2005-03-28\",\"title\":\"Pennis from Heaven\",\"video\":true,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"Self\",\"credit_id\":\"5ed7ae5e528b2e002073624e\",\"order\":3,\"media_type\":\"movie\"},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/uFxfOzGTuI4ttzQXZD2QiC3x1VP.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":1071583,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Just a Boy From Tupelo: Bringing Elvis to the Big Screen\",\"overview\":\"Director Baz Luhrmann, actors Austin Butler and Tom Hanks, and others explore the life and legacy of Elvis Presley and 