n is depleted during World War II, a professional all-female baseball league springs up in the Midwest, funded by publicity-hungry candy maker Walter Harvey. Competitive sisters Dottie Hinson and Kit Keller spar with each other, scout Ernie Capadino and grumpy has-been coach Jimmy Dugan on their way to fame.\",\"popularity\":18.967,\"poster_path\":\"/nKctKGwUO1PZFupNAdnBU3Q7wgT.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1992-07-01\",\"title\":\"A League of Their Own\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.171,\"vote_count\":1191,\"character\":\"Jimmy Dugan\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe441e9251416c750297e3\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/lenFpoDZMlMvBWml8CF682x9NTQ.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,18,36],\"id\":6538,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Charlie Wilson's War\",\"overview\":\"The true story of Texas congressman Charlie Wilson's covert dealings in Afghanistan, where his efforts to assist rebels in their war with the Soviets had some unforeseen and long-reaching effects.\",\"popularity\":12.096,\"poster_path\":\"/45FghqcdSYRWK7PsHUInaFPNd8l.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2007-12-19\",\"title\":\"Charlie Wilson's War\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.542,\"vote_count\":1274,\"character\":\"Charlie Wilson\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4459c3a36847f8090d7d\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/c1XKKUHZIhAaZbrVjxkIxgMncSC.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,35,53,80,10751],\"id\":6951,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Turner \\u0026 Hooch\",\"overview\":\"Scott Turner has 3 days left in the local police department before he moves to a bigger city to get some 'real' cases—not just misdemeanors. When Amos Reed is murdered, Scott sets himself on the case, but the closest thing to a witness to the murder is Reed's dog, Hooch, which Scott has to take care of—to avoid Hooch being 'put to sleep'.\",\"popularity\":15.805,\"poster_path\":\"/g3LC4mc17fQIFnPsMi81zzKC5gF.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1989-07-28\",\"title\":\"Turner \\u0026 Hooch\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.356,\"vote_count\":1113,\"character\":\"Scott Turner\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe446ac3a36847f8094a57\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/ioqaIhJSkwa9DGRHGtOOUTiGRs2.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[12,18],\"id\":8358,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Cast Away\",\"overview\":\"Chuck Nolan, a top international manager for FedEx, and Kelly, a Ph.D. student, are in love and heading towards marriage. Then Chuck's plane to Malaysia crashes at sea during a terrible storm. He's the only survivor, and finds himself marooned on a desolate island. With no way to escape, Chuck must find ways to survive in his new home.\",\"popularity\":35.042,\"poster_path\":\"/6Zp6oj4QxpYFFvrVtb4kGc7r0jK.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2000-12-22\",\"title\":\"Cast Away\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.659,\"vote_count\":10201,\"character\":\"Chuck Noland\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe44a2c3a36847f80a14df\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/4HJN6dyyPMJTimMglfEdVxjW2p5.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,27,53],\"id\":11974,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The 'Burbs\",\"overview\":\"When secretive new neighbors move in next door, suburbanite Ray Peterson and his friends let their paranoia get the best of them as they start to suspect the newcomers of evildoings and commence an investigation. But it's hardly how Ray, who much prefers drinking beer, reading his newspaper and watching a ball game on the tube expected to spend his vacation.\",\"popularity\":17.497,\"poster_path\":\"/vrVPAcv2njVdnkqhBwGBc7UxCjz.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1989-02-17\",\"title\":\"The 'Burbs\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.736,\"vote_count\":1038,\"character\":\"Ray Peterson\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe44ad9251416c7503d27b\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/ff1y897CAnQpLQ2QiyfDJtX9Qcq.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"id\":12309,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Bachelor Party\",\"overview\":\"On the eve of his wedding to his longtime girlfriend, unassuming nice guy Rick is dragged out for a night of debauchery by his friends.\",\"popularity\":18.26,\"poster_path\":\"/cbCyhkp6n2QRudYqbWimQTjdxLl.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1984-06-29\",\"title\":\"Bachelor Party\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.297,\"vote_count\":565,\"character\":\"Rick Gassko\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe44da9251416c7504336f\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/wdVM1soj2s9ixta8R7NDwoZA12Y.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,10749],\"id\":9489,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"You've Got Mail\",\"overview\":\"Book superstore magnate, Joe Fox and independent book shop owner, Kathleen Kelly fall in love in the anonymity of the Internet—both blissfully unaware that he's trying to put her out of business.\",\"popularity\":34.773,\"poster_path\":\"/dkPPPpgs9ME6V5qrdK9yIJ7JUrI.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1998-12-17\",\"title\":\"You've Got Mail\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.666,\"vote_count\":2864,\"character\":\"Joe Fox\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe44fec3a36847f80b660d\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/vxhnRV7jGncAZmf0FFHMs6rFHWn.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,18,10749,10402],\"id\":9591,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"That Thing You Do!\",\"overview\":\"A Pennsylvania band scores a hit in 1964 and rides the star-making machinery as long as it can, with lots of help from its manager.\",\"popularity\":16.737,\"poster_path\":\"/oIaeMi7d5YsX95O1BOZtK4HeoM4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1996-10-04\",\"title\":\"That Thing You Do!\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.9,\"vote_count\":718,\"character\":\"Mr. White\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe450ec3a36847f80b9ba3\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/9i3oIhKuFGMj6PwXqcZi9blgJnd.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[80,35,18],\"id\":9586,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Bonfire of the Vanities\",\"overview\":\"After his mistress runs over a black teen, a Wall Street hotshot sees his life unravel in the spotlight; A down-and-out reporter breaks the story and opportunists clamber to use it to their advantage.\",\"popularity\":11.168,\"poster_path\":\"/pdrPrygZ5dVKi8UxrUXMmq1k2iO.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1990-12-21\",\"title\":\"The Bonfire of the Vanities\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.6,\"vote_count\":408,\"character\":\"Sherman McCoy\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe450dc3a36847f80b9965\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/tUeMIPdYo1eXJZdBhxw4118RIAm.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18],\"id\":9800,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Philadelphia\",\"overview\":\"Two competing lawyers join forces to sue a prestigious law firm for AIDS discrimination. As their unlikely friendship develops their courage overcomes the prejudice and corruption of their powerful adversaries.\",\"popularity\":22.492,\"poster_path\":\"/tFe5Yoo5zT495okA49bq1vPPkiV.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1993-12-22\",\"title\":\"Philadelphia\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.729,\"vote_count\":3771,\"character\":\"Andrew Beckett\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe452fc3a36847f80c1111\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/1xLAsn946MjYthpahzx04jZWpFT.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[14,18,10770],\"id\":27348,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Mazes and Monsters\",\"overview\":\"Bound together by a desire to play \\\"Mazes and Monsters,\\\" Robbie and his four college classmates decide to move the board game into the local cavern. Robbie loses his mind, and the line between reality and fantasy fuse into a harrowing nightmare.\",\"popularity\":7.352,\"poster_path\":\"/sEOR43kpx1xBNMQjGBgHvN3QBIm.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1982-12-27\",\"title\":\"Mazes and Monsters\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.384,\"vote_count\":69,\"character\":\"Robbie Wheeling\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4543c3a368484e05034f\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/cj0VkGBTywa7WTIPPW9xgqmUVWl.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[53,9648],\"id\":13448,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Angels \\u0026 Demons\",\"overview\":\"Harvard symbologist Robert Langdon is recruited by the Vatican to investigate the apparent return of the Illuminati - a secret, underground organization - after four cardinals are kidnapped on the night of the papal conclave.\",\"popularity\":35.405,\"poster_path\":\"/hrvNVd0GDeytbDhduWa3SFKmg4A.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2009-05-13\",\"title\":\"Angels \\u0026 Demons\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.696,\"vote_count\":6208,\"character\":\"Robert Langdon\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe45699251416c75055939\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/cb1ltycrzQZyqDBYVXcAIRvvGkx.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10752,18,10749],\"id\":35866,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Every Time We Say Goodbye\",\"overview\":\"An American flyer who joined the RAF before his country was in the war is recovering from a leg injury in Jerusalem. Through an English friend he meets a quiet Jewish girl whose close-knit family originally came from Spain. The two are attracted to each other but she is convinced their diverse backgrounds mean it could never work.\",\"popularity\":4.96,\"poster_path\":\"/fMiWlS4jNZysUquP6CZfKswukMo.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1986-11-14\",\"title\":\"Every Time We Say Goodbye\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.095,\"vote_count\":42,\"character\":\"David Bradley\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe45bb9251416c9103c7ad\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/1ISqiWSbKc1UVMheI2xlO66Z6Lb.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,35,10749],\"id\":29968,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Nothing in Common\",\"overview\":\"On his way up the corporate ladder, David Basner confronts his greatest challenge: his father.\",\"popularity\":8.227,\"poster_path\":\"/m2G6Idl1CKJwOt8aFsnJk08sfDP.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1986-07-29\",\"title\":\"Nothing in Common\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.9,\"vote_count\":93,\"character\":\"David Basner\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4608c3a368484e07ceef\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hTc55dlCPMP4oqrUU66GjKjSblp.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18],\"id\":64685,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Extremely Loud \\u0026 Incredibly Close\",\"overview\":\"A year after his father's death, Oskar, a troubled young boy, discovers a mysterious key he believes was left for him by his father and embarks on a scavenger hunt to find the matching lock.\",\"popularity\":11.074,\"poster_path\":\"/6pszViNvKr1r31pP7gJNYDHEx5P.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2011-12-25\",\"title\":\"Extremely Loud \\u0026 Incredibly Close\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.986,\"vote_count\":1838,\"character\":\"Thomas Schell\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe46e4c3a368484e0a9869\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8ho0cYg9wDkUfbxnvA4CG3DO5V7.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"id\":19259,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Volunteers\",\"overview\":\"After his rich father refuses to pay his debt, compulsive gambler Lawrence Bourne III joins the Peace Corps to evade angry creditors. In Thailand, he is assigned to build a bridge for the local villagers with the help of American-As-Apple-Pie WSU Grad Tom Tuttle and the beautiful and down-to earth Beth Wexler.  What they don't realize is that the bridge is coveted by the U.S. Army, a local Communist force, and a powerful drug lord. Together with the help of At Toon, the only English speaking native, they must fight off the three opposing forces and find out what is right for the villagers, as well as themselves.\",\"popularity\":7.849,\"poster_path\":\"/igpM22TsXBYX54BngFDSSvZ3nr4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1985-08-16\",\"title\":\"Volunteers\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.465,\"vote_count\":128,\"character\":\"Lawrence Whatley Bourne III\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe47ca9251416c750a58d9\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/vQ4ZkCjfeedcf4nNiQLoDUAqxv.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10751,35],\"id\":82424,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Small Fry\",\"overview\":\"A fast food restaurant mini variant of Buzz forcibly switches places with the real Buzz and his friends have to deal with the obnoxious impostor.\",\"popularity\":9.981,\"poster_path\":\"/8siICxMft0JSWZDq9YrXh5U5PZx.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2011-11-23\",\"title\":\"Small Fry\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.922,\"vote_count\":493,\"character\":\"Woody (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe48509251416c91087f67\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/Tvn4W6qdbqhW5qcL7FZgb6570b.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10751,35],\"id\":77887,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Hawaiian Vacation\",\"overview\":\"The toys throw Ken and Barbie a Hawaiian vacation in Bonnie's room.\",\"popularity\":11.656,\"poster_path\":\"/7DrKSrV5NCgR9Ky4WNzgM6ybqdq.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2011-06-16\",\"title\":\"Hawaiian Vacation\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.005,\"vote_count\":582,\"character\":\"Woody (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4982c3a368484e12f03b\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hl5twrpQBa1VhpsaLFphByGUGt.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,10749,18],\"id\":59861,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Larry Crowne\",\"overview\":\"When he suddenly finds himself without his long-standing blue-collar job, Larry Crowne enrolls at his local college to start over. There, he becomes part of an eclectic community of students and develops a crush on his teacher.\",\"popularity\":15.837,\"poster_path\":\"/8GDM7RqM6J1vNUdlU94rmtlNa3e.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2011-06-30\",\"title\":\"Larry Crowne\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.948,\"vote_count\":1165,\"character\":\"Larry Crowne\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe499dc3a36847f81a3b1f\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/fLrGQzvfhTwn9m7AqlJh65FMFfG.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,18,53],\"id\":109424,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Captain Phillips\",\"overview\":\"The true story of Captain Richard Phillips and the 2009 hijacking by Somali pirates of the US-flagged MV Maersk Alabama, the first American cargo ship to be hijacked in two hundred years.\",\"popularity\":20.067,\"poster_path\":\"/vjsEi2JytAT76qrtUHPIhXExZAm.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2013-10-10\",\"title\":\"Captain Phillips\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.6,\"vote_count\":6223,\"character\":\"Captain Richard Phillips\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4ab5c3a36847f81dd51d\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8t2wI3IZVWucJaULiYLlWTrQ6bS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99,18],\"id\":170039,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Killing Lincoln\",\"overview\":\"April 14, 1865. One gunshot. One assassin hell-bent on killing a tyrant, as he charged the 16th President of the United States. And in one moment, our nation was forever changed. This is the most dramatic and resonant crime in American history—the true story of the killing of Abraham Lincoln.\",\"popularity\":5.183,\"poster_path\":\"/zqlOXMsJ0sSyForOe93BSfNW3Pi.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2013-02-16\",\"title\":\"Killing Lincoln\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.8,\"vote_count\":50,\"character\":\"Himself - Narrator\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4cf0c3a36847f8245b71\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/knY4ttZI6K4aiMyQ0kTekLHP2cc.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,878],\"id\":83542,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Cloud Atlas\",\"overview\":\"A set of six nested stories spanning time between the 19th century and a distant post-apocalyptic future. Cloud Atlas explores how the actions and consequences of individual lives impact one another throughout the past, the present and the future. Action, mystery and romance weave through the story as one soul is shaped from a killer into a hero and a single act of kindness ripples across centuries to inspire a revolution in the distant future.  Based on the award winning novel by David Mitchell. Directed by Tom Tykwer and the Wachowskis.\",\"popularity\":22.695,\"poster_path\":\"/8naVv2Xu3rWI5JKHz0vCujx6GaJ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2012-10-26\",\"title\":\"Cloud Atlas\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.873,\"vote_count\":6495,\"character\":\"Dr. Henry Goose / Hotel Manager / Isaac Sachs / Dermot Hoggins / Cavendish Look-a-Like Actor / Zachry\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe48a89251416c91094135\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/1umAQ4S1HeqEdgnxfAIHkjREj6C.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[53,18],\"id\":296098,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Bridge of Spies\",\"overview\":\"During the Cold War, the Soviet Union captures U.S. pilot Francis Gary Powers after shooting down his U-2 spy plane. Sentenced to 10 years in prison, Powers' only hope is New York lawyer James Donovan, recruited by a CIA operative to negotiate his release. Donovan boards a plane to Berlin, hoping to win the young man's freedom through a prisoner exchange. If all goes well, the Russians would get Rudolf Abel, the convicted spy who Donovan defended in court.\",\"popularity\":15.876,\"poster_path\":\"/fmOOjHAQzxr0c1sfcY4qkiSRBH6.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2015-10-15\",\"title\":\"Bridge of Spies\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.227,\"vote_count\":6263,\"character\":\"James B. Donovan\",\"credit_id\":\"54304fd80e0a26464c000ffd\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/y3w1fdR3QfYy22ryvhRl6YyHohs.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[9648,53,18,28],\"id\":207932,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Inferno\",\"overview\":\"After waking up in a hospital with amnesia, professor Robert Langdon and a doctor must race against time to foil a deadly global plot.\",\"popularity\":25.701,\"poster_path\":\"/dtMJQzCxw2AY6tfcxhzlFpiD3BM.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2016-10-13\",\"title\":\"Inferno\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.052,\"vote_count\":5770,\"character\":\"Robert Langdon\",\"credit_id\":\"5475a40dc3a3687fd9000e10\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/AbZZz3QwbCrF1hpJfvtl0uZBGGN.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,18],\"id\":270010,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"A Hologram for the King\",\"overview\":\"Alan Clay, a struggling American businessman, travels to Saudi Arabia to sell a new technology to the King, only to be challenged by endless Middle Eastern bureaucracy, a perpetually absent monarch, and a suspicious growth on his back.\",\"popularity\":12.452,\"poster_path\":\"/wmjWGb2tqtOA4XPnK1tpIfzRtSQ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2016-04-22\",\"title\":\"A Hologram for the King\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.83,\"vote_count\":1014,\"character\":\"Alan Clay\",\"credit_id\":\"5374eb17c3a3681509002f2d\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/phWZP5FESItyhQcqk6sWz35nUtP.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,36],\"id\":363676,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Sully\",\"overview\":\"On 15 January 2009, the world witnessed the 'Miracle on the Hudson' when Captain 'Sully' Sullenberger glided his disabled plane onto the Hudson River, saving the lives of all 155 souls aboard. However, even as Sully was being heralded by the public and the media for his unprecedented feat of aviation skill, an investigation was unfolding that threatened to destroy his reputation and career.\",\"popularity\":24.352,\"poster_path\":\"/r09ivJ1GGh5WArqRViRYDQLrTVG.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2016-09-07\",\"title\":\"Sully\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.169,\"vote_count\":6498,\"character\":\"Chesley 'Sully' Sullenberger\",\"credit_id\":\"561c1d9cc3a3682251002307\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[12,99,18],\"id\":374164,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Boatlift\",\"overview\":\"From the midst of 9/11, one of the darkest moments in American history, comes this inspiring and relatively unknown story. When the twin towers fell, hundreds of thousands of people ran to the water's edge. They soon realized that Manhattan is, indeed, an island. And that they were trapped. Within moments, an armada of every vessel that could get to the city's seawall spontaneously organized. Dashing into the teeth of danger, hundreds of boats pulled together and, without any formal planning, military or otherwise, they pulled off an ad-hoc sea evacuation that became the largest in history. Their story of courage and resolve reminds us of the powerful spirit that rose among us, on that fateful day. Narrated by Tom Hanks. Directed by Eddie Rosenstein.\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":\"/cOisFeyE0FGwsjy1XKLAn7RxukD.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2011-09-08\",\"title\":\"Boatlift\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":10.0,\"vote_count\":1,\"character\":\"Narrator\",\"credit_id\":\"567d70c59251412e52004ea2\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[18,14],\"id\":377229,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Ocean at the End of the Lane\",\"overview\":\"A man attending a funeral in his hometown comes face-to-face with his past when he is confronted with memories of mistrust, adultery, abuse, and a fantastical journey that couldn't possibly be real. It couldn't possibly be real, but the memory of a mysterious girl named Lettie Hempstock ties each bizarre childhood occurrence to the last.\",\"popularity\":1.21,\"poster_path\":null,\"release_date\":\"\",\"title\":\"The Ocean at the End of the Lane\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"The Man\",\"credit_id\":\"569520fa9251417422000484\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/q62bpQ67qaXY0u6b2wFEnQYIbPd.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10751,12,16,35,14],\"id\":301528,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Toy Story 4\",\"overview\":\"Woody has always been confident about his place in the world and that his priority is taking care of his kid, whether that's Andy or Bonnie. But when Bonnie adds a reluctant new toy called \\\"Forky\\\" to her room, a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends will show Woody how big the world can be for a toy.\",\"popularity\":71.492,\"poster_path\":\"/w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2019-06-19\",\"title\":\"Toy Story 4\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.533,\"vote_count\":8780,\"character\":\"Woody (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"577a78b8c3a368770400058f\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/xJHHkTwPfMGKWjE8BKs53XQgxE1.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,16,80,18,10749,878],\"id\":426128,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Electric City\",\"overview\":\"A view of the future of civilization, presented through the lens of provocative themes such as energy consumption, freedom of information, crime and punishment.\",\"popularity\":1.97,\"poster_path\":\"/nFH5AylexDc47BhE0gmxLVkdpD1.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2012-07-17\",\"title\":\"Electric City\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.4,\"vote_count\":4,\"character\":\"Cleveland Carr (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"582af4d9c3a368360f0448cc\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/j1z8S3ZfgDn47AegrQoslsdAoHl.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":414792,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"California Typewriter\",\"overview\":\"A story about people whose lives are connected by typewriters. A meditation on creativity and technology featuring Tom Hanks, John Mayer, Sam Shepard, David McCullough and others.\",\"popularity\":3.0,\"poster_path\":\"/8tdOPx8TZ6y85BHD0G3sS8anuMY.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2017-08-18\",\"title\":\"California Typewriter\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.917,\"vote_count\":30,\"character\":\"Himself\",\"credit_id\":\"57d0d14492514173ac00573b\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/vQuIi5iOCN3V6yg7nbP5HUiVnpK.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10751,12,14,35],\"id\":5255,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Polar Express\",\"overview\":\"When a doubting young boy takes an extraordinary train ride to the North Pole, he embarks on a journey of self-discovery that shows him that the wonder of life never fades for those who believe.\",\"popularity\":36.122,\"poster_path\":\"/eOoCzH0MqeGr2taUZO4SwG416PF.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2004-11-10\",\"title\":\"The Polar Express\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.705,\"vote_count\":5516,\"character\":\"Hero Boy / Father / Conductor / Hobo / Scrooge / Santa Claus\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4400c3a36847f807c9c1\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":121100,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Horatio's Drive: America's First Road Trip\",\"overview\":\"In the spring of 1903, on a whim and a fifty-dollar bet, Dr. Horatio Nelson Jackson set off from San Francisco in a 20-horsepower Winton touring car hoping to become the first person to cross the United States in the new-fangled \\\"horseless carriage.\\\" Most people doubted that the automobile had much of a future. Jackson's trip would prove them wrong.\",\"popularity\":1.501,\"poster_path\":\"/iglGxGhlo2ul2ciXXxDAHg3lv3x.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2003-10-06\",\"title\":\"Horatio's Drive: America's First Road Trip\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.3,\"vote_count\":3,\"character\":\"Horatio Nelson Jackson (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4a5ac3a368484e14e787\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99,18],\"id\":456703,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Walking the Mile: The Making of The Green Mile\",\"overview\":\"Frank Darabont explains how this new project was introduced thru a phone call from Stephen King as \\\"another prison tale\\\" if he was interested to make it, the answer was not, King expose his concept idea in few words, however Frank asking to Stephen send the script to him firstly, when the first tale was finished and sent to Darabont, after reading such odd story, asking for more, so King replied \\\"You must wait as anybody else\\\", receiving later all other tales Frank wrote a screenplay on 8 weeks, so come up \\\"the Green Mile\\\"\",\"popularity\":2.273,\"poster_path\":null,\"release_date\":\"2000-06-13\",\"title\":\"Walking the Mile: The Making of The Green Mile\",\"video\":true,\"vote_average\":7.1,\"vote_count\":9,\"character\":\"Himself / Paul Edgecomb\",\"credit_id\":\"5910d53ec3a36864ec033b16\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[16,35,10770],\"id\":478639,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The David S. Pumpkins Halloween Special\",\"overview\":\"Set in a small suburban town on All Hallows' Eve, the special centers on David Pumpkins and his skeleton sidekicks who show a young boy and his sister the true meaning of Halloween, answering none of their questions along the way.\",\"popularity\":1.455,\"poster_path\":\"/3uoVw6eGWi3ek9c0DYP4r0O6AkX.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2017-10-28\",\"title\":\"The David S. Pumpkins Halloween Special\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.9,\"vote_count\":16,\"character\":\"David S. Pumpkins\",\"credit_id\":\"59ce6a1fc3a3686aa9019e54\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":224355,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Rebels of Oakland: The A's, The Raiders, The '70s\",\"overview\":\"\\\"As soon as you hear the title to this new one, you know exactly what it's about and why it's likely to be good, especially if you were a sports fan growing up in the 1970s. Even to good boys all the way across the country in New Hampshire, the authority-flouting baseball A's and football Raiders were magical. Not only did they win championships, they did it amid clubhouse brawls, feuds with an owner and a general embrace of the 1960s aesthetic.  Filmmakers Rick Bernstein and Ross Greenburg tell the stories of these turbulent, talented teams and show how they perfectly fit their city. Oakland was blue collar and home to hardcore hard-core 1960s rebellion, exemplified by the Black Panthers. Oakland, especially, was not San Francisco, the effete, world-class city across the bay.\\\"\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":\"/rc9ovrusS56WpuR79BaYksmEEhq.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2003-12-10\",\"title\":\"Rebels of Oakland: The A's, The Raiders, The '70s\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"\",\"credit_id\":\"5a1c161cc3a3680b8a0533af\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/91qfG6VaxRsCh1SbIi1w2vxknsL.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,35,10751],\"id\":863,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Toy Story 2\",\"overview\":\"Andy heads off to Cowboy Camp, leaving his toys to their own devices. Things shift into high gear when an obsessive toy collector named Al McWhiggen, owner of Al's Toy Barn kidnaps Woody. Andy's toys mount a daring rescue mission, Buzz Lightyear meets his match and Woody has to decide where he and his heart truly belong.\",\"popularity\":83.92,\"poster_path\":\"/xVhEI1WCgNCCa5I86AqiwuZoog3.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1999-10-30\",\"title\":\"Toy Story 2\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.585,\"vote_count\":12512,\"character\":\"Woody (voice)\",\"credit_id\":\"5ac0152ec3a368443f034084\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/xXBnM6uSTk6qqCf0SRZKXcga9Ba.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10752,28,18],\"id\":516486,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Greyhound\",\"overview\":\"A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers across the treacherous waters of the “Black Pit” to the front lines of WW2. With no air cover protection for 5 days, the captain and his convoy must battle the surrounding enemy Nazi U-boats in order to give the allies a chance to win the war.\",\"popularity\":31.801,\"poster_path\":\"/kjMbDciooTbJPofVXgAoFjfX8Of.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2020-07-10\",\"title\":\"Greyhound\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.419,\"vote_count\":2424,\"character\":\"Commander Krause\",\"credit_id\":\"5ac6db57c3a36834de01a435\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/oE6bhqqVFyIECtBzqIuvh6JdaB5.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[878,18,12],\"id\":522402,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Finch\",\"overview\":\"On a post-apocalyptic Earth, a robot, built to protect the life of his dying creator's beloved dog, learns about life, love, friendship, and what it means to be human.\",\"popularity\":67.822,\"poster_path\":\"/jKuDyqx7jrjiR9cDzB5pxzhJAdv.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2021-11-04\",\"title\":\"Finch\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.971,\"vote_count\":2865,\"character\":\"Finch\",\"credit_id\":\"5aecfbc99251411d1e0022e1\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/mU7A8sM6TFC5MuFxl2i0rLbEHLk.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[99],\"id\":567649,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Last Mile\",\"overview\":\"It's been 25 years since “Philadelphia” premiered, and since then, we've come a long way in the fight to end AIDS. In partnership with Coca Cola and RED, \\\"The Last Mile\\\" explores how far we've come.\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":\"/fp3mOjFJ55HhHVULBMs5oqtzWk2.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2018-12-01\",\"title\":\"The Last Mile\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":10.0,\"vote_count\":1,\"character\":\"Himself\",\"credit_id\":\"5c0e5c92c3a36825150c845b\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/oyBZyY5GdzZdofVVsDda49QmvFP.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,37,12,28],\"id\":581032,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"News of the World\",\"overview\":\"A Texan traveling across the wild West bringing the news of the world to local townspeople, agrees to help rescue a young girl who was kidnapped.\",\"popularity\":13.708,\"poster_path\":\"/fYQCgVRsQTEfUrP7cW5iAFVYOlh.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2020-12-25\",\"title\":\"News of the World\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.005,\"vote_count\":1519,\"character\":\"Captain Jefferson Kyle Kidd\",\"credit_id\":\"5c5f525ac3a3683cc68eab43\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hFeW14oNRU0hKiILAUKZVrilFBg.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10402,99],\"id\":31107,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The 25th Anniversary Rock and Roll Hall of Fame Concerts\",\"overview\":\"On October 29th and 30th, 2009, rock 'n' roll royalty held court at Madison Square Garden for what have been called 'the best concerts ever,' and 'where rock 'n' roll history was made.'\\r The concerts featured a who's who of rock 'n' roll from the '50s to the '90s and included artists performing together in unprecedented combinations that will most likely never be witnessed again.\\r 'The 25th Anniversary Rock and Roll Hall of Fame Anniversary Concerts' included sets by Crosby, Stills \\u0026 Nash; Stevie Wonder; Paul Simon; Simon \\u0026 Garfunkel; Aretha Franklin; Metallica; U2; Jeff Beck and Bruce Springsteen \\u0026 the E-Street Band. Joining this iconic line up on stage were special guests including: Jerry Lee Lewis, Bonnie Raitt, Jackson Browne, Smokey Robinson, B.B. King, Annie Lennox, Lou Reed, John Fogerty, Mick Jagger, Fergie and others.\\r A 4-hour special of the concerts aired on HBO to high ratings, and was seen by tens of millions. Now this historic event is available on DVD.\",\"popularity\":4.983,\"poster_path\":\"/yvVW8X56vjGWEP7zLJyLWK19mk8.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2009-11-29\",\"title\":\"The 25th Anniversary Rock and Roll Hall of Fame Concerts\",\"video\":true,\"vote_average\":8.4,\"vote_count\":11,\"character\":\"Host\",\"credit_id\":\"5cb28f639251411ed620788c\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[12,28,10751],\"id\":638302,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Major Matt Mason\",\"overview\":\"Plot unknown. Based on a Mattel action figure.\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":null,\"release_date\":\"\",\"title\":\"Major Matt Mason\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"Major Matt Mason\",\"credit_id\":\"5d9ea80ff0647c003fcda073\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/t4OhMwOgQnBPmT9zYSytYJGeFCN.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10770,99],\"id\":785930,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Celebrating America\",\"overview\":\"Inauguration Day special showcasing the American people’s resilience, heroism, and unified commitment to coming together as a nation to heal and rebuild.\",\"popularity\":2.024,\"poster_path\":\"/bor7aoKx0TvaRjqiGcal4Traaj.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2021-01-20\",\"title\":\"Celebrating America\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\