atic National Convention in 2008, this short documentary is a tribute to all veterans of the United States military.\",\"popularity\":0.6,\"poster_path\":\"/AtSei5DgWEpJM3x8yS0OhLMYoRw.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2008-08-27\",\"title\":\"A Timeless Call\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0,\"character\":\"Host / Narrator\",\"credit_id\":\"63bba4ffae6f093c82ed10e8\",\"order\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/Ag6qhzsJd3k1NKuNrG9RmhZDMh7.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,80],\"id\":640,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Catch Me If You Can\",\"overview\":\"A true story about Frank Abagnale Jr. who, before his 19th birthday, successfully conned millions of dollars worth of checks as a Pan Am pilot, doctor, and legal prosecutor. An FBI agent makes it his mission to put him behind bars. But Frank not only eludes capture, he revels in the pursuit.\",\"popularity\":60.143,\"poster_path\":\"/sdYgEkKCDPWNU6KnoL4qd8xZ4w7.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2002-12-16\",\"title\":\"Catch Me If You Can\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.965,\"vote_count\":13814,\"character\":\"Carl Hanratty\",\"credit_id\":\"52fe4263c3a36847f801a643\",\"order\":1},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/5F968Q4vZ2p5Mm4tzjNpwG93uVy.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,35,80],\"id\":10023,\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Dragnet\",\"overview\":\"LAPD Sgt. Joe Friday -- the equally straight-laced nephew of the famous police sergeant of the same name -- is paired up with a young, freewheeling detective named Pep Streebeck. After investigating some strange robberies at the local zoo and the theft of a stockpile of pornographic magazines, they uncover cult activity in the heart of the city and are hot on the case to figure out who's behind it all.\",\"popularity\":11.482,\"poster_path\":\"/2AqQGyY5yM8PCOGxWsMNlegTnDp.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1987-06-23\",\"title\":\"Dragnet\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.937,\"vote_count\":394,\"character\":\"Pep Streebeck\",\"credit_id\":\