nhunt to a war-zone world to capture a one man weapon of mass destruction. As our heroes are propelled into an epic chess game of life and death, love will be challenged, friendships will be torn apart, and sacrifices must be made for the only family Kirk has left: his crew.\",\"poster_path\":\"/7XrRkhMa9lQ71RszzSyVrJVvhyS.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[28,12,878],\"popularity\":31.032,\"release_date\":\"2013-05-05\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.331,\"vote_count\":8387}]},{\"adult\":false,\"id\":192,\"name\":\"Morgan Freeman\",\"original_name\":\"Morgan Freeman\",\"media_type\":\"person\",\"popularity\":75.088,\"gender\":2,\"known_for_department\":\"Acting\",\"profile_path\":\"/jPsLqiYGSofU4s6BjrxnefMfabb.jpg\",\"known_for\":[{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/kXfqcdQKsToO0OUXHcrrNCHDBzO.jpg\",\"id\":278,\"title\":\"The Shawshank Redemption\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Shawshank Redemption\",\"overview\":\"Framed in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.\",\"poster_path\":\"/q6y0Go1tsGEsmtFryDOJo3dEmqu.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[18,80],\"popularity\":120.999,\"release_date\":\"1994-09-23\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.702,\"vote_count\":23656},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hh28CTWLdxTXA5yJgefZ6gUnFDo.jpg\",\"id\":807,\"title\":\"Se7en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Se7en\",\"overview\":\"Two homicide detectives are on a desperate hunt for a serial killer whose crimes are based on the \\\"seven deadly sins\\\" in this dark and haunting film that takes viewers from the tortured remains of one victim to the next. The seasoned Det. Sommerset researches each sin in an effort to get inside the killer's mind, while his novice partner, Mills, scoffs at his efforts to unravel the case.\",\"poster_path\":\"/6yoghtyTpznpBik8EngEmJskVUO.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[80,9648,53],\"popularity\":47.062,\"release_date\":\"1995-09-22\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.366,\"vote_count\":18669},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/ozVwXlfxqNsariipatGwa5px3Pm.jpg\",\"id\":240832,\"title\":\"Lucy\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Lucy\",\"overview\":\"A woman, accidentally caught in a dark deal, turns the tables on her captors and transforms into a merciless warrior evolved beyond human logic.\",\"poster_path\":\"/dhjyfcwEoW6jJ4Q7DpZTp6E58GA.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[28,878],\"popularity\":53.937,\"release_date\":\"2014-07-25\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.432,\"vote_count\":14825}]},{\"adult\":false,\"id\":6384,\"name\":\"Keanu Reeves\",\"original_name\":\"Keanu Reeves\",\"media_type\":\"person\",\"popularity\":66.373,\"gender\":2,\"known_for_department\":\"Acting\",\"profile_path\":\"/4D0PpNI0kmP58hgrwGC3wCjxhnm.jpg\",\"known_for\":[{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/l4QHerTSbMI7qgvasqxP36pqjN6.jpg\",\"id\":603,\"title\":\"The Matrix\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Matrix\",\"overview\":\"Set in the 22nd century, The Matrix tells the story of a computer hacker who joins a group of underground insurgents fighting the vast and powerful computers who now rule the earth.\",\"poster_path\":\"/f89U3ADr1oiB1s9GkdPOEpXUk5H.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[28,878],\"popularity\":71.384,\"release_date\":\"1999-03-30\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.2,\"vote_count\":23099},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/7dzngS8pLkGJpyeskCFcjPO9qLF.jpg\",\"id\":245891,\"title\":\"John Wick\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"John Wick\",\"overview\":\"Ex-hitman John Wick comes out of retirement to track down the gangsters that took everything from him.\",\"poster_path\":\"/wXqWR7dHncNRbxoEGybEy7QTe9h.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[28,53],\"popularity\":174.46,\"release_date\":\"2014-10-22\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.402,\"vote_count\":17211},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/r17jFHAemzcWPPtoO0UxjIX0xas.jpg\",\"id\":324552,\"title\":\"John Wick: Chapter 2\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"John Wick: Chapter 2\",\"overview\":\"John Wick is forced out of retirement by a former associate looking to seize control of a shadowy international assassins’ guild. Bound by a blood oath to aid him, Wick travels to Rome and does battle against some of the world’s most dangerous killers.\",\"poster_path\":\"/hXWBc0ioZP3cN4zCu6SN3YHXZVO.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[28,53,80],\"popularity\":294.191,\"release_date\":\"2017-02-08\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.311,\"vote_count\":11397}]},{\"adult\":false,\"id\":550843,\"name\":\"Elizabeth Olsen\",\"original_name\":\"Elizabeth Olsen\",\"media_type\":\"person\",\"popularity\":24.278,\"gender\":1,\"known_for_department\":\"Acting\",\"profile_path\":\"/upS7wivapuUwGS5ABIpH58vVvL8.jpg\",\"known_for\":[{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/33j33midGw49BBxiqlNZeZ6PZ0O.jpg\",\"id\":85271,\"name\":\"WandaVision\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_name\":\"WandaVision\",\"overview\":\"Wanda Maximoff and Vision—two super-powered beings living idealized suburban lives—begin to suspect that everything is not as it seems.\",\"poster_path\":\"/frobUz2X5Pc8OiVZU8Oo5K3NKMM.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"genre_ids\":[10765,9648,18],\"popularity\":66.691,\"first_air_date\":\"2021-01-15\",\"vote_average\":8.283,\"vote_count\":10992,\"origin_country\":[\"US\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/zCjZfevPFBbOh2SAx2syIBHSqEI.jpg\",\"id\":124905,\"title\":\"Godzilla\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Godzilla\",\"overview\":\"Ford Brody, a Navy bomb expert, has just reunited with his family in San Francisco when he is forced to go to Japan to help his estranged father, Joe. Soon, both men are swept up in an escalating crisis when an ancient alpha predator arises from the sea to combat malevolent adversaries that threaten the survival of humanity. The creatures leave colossal destruction in their wake, as they make their way toward their final battleground: San Francisco.\",\"poster_path\":\"/iBZhbCVhLpyxAfW1B8ePUxjScrx.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[28,18,878],\"popularity\":73.711,\"release_date\":\"2014-05-14\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.276,\"vote_count\":8135},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/iKUwhA4DUxMcNKu5lLSbDFwwilk.jpg\",\"id\":453395,\"title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"overview\":\"Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.\",\"poster_path\":\"/9Gtg2DzBhmYamXBS1hKAhiwbBKS.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"genre_ids\":[14,28,12],\"popularity\":266.886,\"release_date\":\"2022-05-04\",\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.383,\"vote_count\":7322}]}],\"total_pages\":1000,\"total_results\":20000}"
